name: hastoggle-pii
version: 1.0.0
description: >-
  Shapes that carry subscriber data past Entire's built-in layers. The built-in
  pii.email scanner needs a real local part, so every masked form of an address
  reaches the public checkpoints repo untouched; that is how 124 partial
  addresses were published on 2026-09-14. This pack holds no data of its own —
  it is committed, and anything listed here would be published by being listed.
  Actual values (subscriber domains) belong in .entire/redactors/local/, which
  is gitignored.

rules:
  - id: masked-email
    description: >-
      An address with the local part starred, bulleted, or elided — REDACTED,
